#: ../../library/math.rst:132
msgid ""
"Evaluates to ``n! / (k! * (n - k)!)`` when ``k <= n`` and evaluates to zero "
"when ``k > n``."
msgstr "當 ``k <= n`` 時其值為 ``n! / (k! * (n - k)!)``，否則其值為 ``0``。"

#: ../../library/math.rst:135
